<title>PORTUGAL: SOCCER-AFRICA BEAT EUROPE 2-1 IN ALL-STAR MATCH.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-AFRICA BEAT EUROPE 2-1 IN ALL-STAR MATCH.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of Europe vs Africa All Star</p>
<p>friendly at Benfica's Stadium of Light on Wednesday:</p>
<p>     Europe	   1</p>
<p>     Africa	   2</p>
<p>Europe: Vincent Guerin 43</p>
<p>Africa: Abedi Pele 14, Mustapha Hadji 78</p>
